    {
      "name": "Modo de ocorrência",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "occurrence-mode-selected",
      "description": "Gol ativo; punição é escolhida antes da camisa. Demonstração estática sem registrar eventos.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-modes\" aria-label=\"Ocorrência\"><button class=\"ds-mode ds-mode-selected\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Gol</button><button class=\"ds-mode\" aria-pressed=\"false\">2 min</button><button class=\"ds-mode\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Amarelo</button><button class=\"ds-mode\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Vermelho</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-modes{display:flex;background:#FFFFFF}.ds-mode{flex:1;min-width:0;height:48px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:#FFFFFF;color:#182E29;font:500 12px/16px \"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-mode:hover,.ds-mode:active{background:#E5F1E9}.ds-mode-selected{background:#174F42;color:#FFFFFF}.ds-mode-selected:hover,.ds-mode-selected:active{background:#103D33}.ds-mode:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #285CA7;outline-offset:-2px}"
    },
    {
